<title>MEXICO: Mexico Bondes rate unchanged at auction.</title>
<headline>Mexico Bondes rate unchanged at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rate on Mexican government 728-day Bondes, was unchanged at 1.22 percent above the 28-day Cetes rate at the central bank auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 728-day Bondes were assigned at 97.98744 pesos.</p>
<p>Demand for the Bondes was 1.215 billion pesos, compared with the 900 million offered by the Banco de Mexico.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
